                                "sense_id": "38e309af-3843-33b8-bfd9-be683eaa442c",
                                "text": "The first day of August a bushement of Frenchemen came to the cawsey but a myle and halfe out of Caleys, where they brenned howses, toke many men prisonars, droffe away horses […]."
